            "I'm a casual bike rider.",
            "I recently moved to a city with more hills and rough paths.",
            "I like biking even in rainy weather and in the forest."
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "turn": 7,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Thank you so much for sharing your knowledge and asking such thoughtful questions! I hope the information helps you get the most out of your bike upgrades. If you have more questions in the future, feel free to ask. Happy and safe riding\u2014farewell!",
          "user_rubrik": null,
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
