          "text": "For effective, low-hassle bike maintenance\u2014prioritizing comfort, sustainability, and minimal DIY\u2014focus on these essential tools and kits:\n\n**Absolute Essentials (for comfort, safety, and quick fixes):**\n- **Mini-pump or CO2 inflator:** For on-the-go tire inflation, especially important for rough, hilly, or rainy rides ([clueweb22-en0032-04-04212], [clueweb22-en0024-16-10595]).\n- **Tire levers & patch kit:** Lets you fix flats without replacing tubes\u2014reduces waste and cost ([clueweb22-en0032-04-04212], [clueweb22-en0024-16-10595]).\n- **Multi-tool (with Allen/hex keys):** Adjusts saddle, handlebars, and accessories for comfort upgrades; look for lock-on grips and ergonomic tweaks ([clueweb22-en0014-14-13800], [clueweb22-en0032-04-04212]).\n- **Chain lube & cleaning brush:** Keeps",
