        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Good to know! Considering my history of back pain, are there any important features to consider regarding bicycle seats?",
          "user_rubrik": "Considering my history of back pain, are there any important features to consider regarding bicycle seats? ",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "For your mountain bike and back pain, prioritize a comfortable and supportive saddle with adequate padding, especially for your sit bones. Look for a broad or wider-at-the-rear design to provide a good base. Ensure the seat height is adjustable to achieve proper posture, with the saddle supporting your weight evenly from front to back. A bike's suspension also significantly helps absorb shocks from rough terrain, reducing strain on your back.",
