          "ptkb_provenance": [
            "1. I recently moved to a city with more hills and rough paths.",
            "2. I value comfort over speed.",
            "3. I like biking even in rainy weather and in the forest.",
            "4. I prefer upgrading things over replacing them.",
            "5. I care about sustainability and avoiding waste.",
            "6. I'm a casual bike rider.",
            "7. I sometimes get overwhelmed by too many technical choices.",
            "8. I am not really handy with DIY."
          ]
