          "user_utterance": "Great list! Considering my history of back pain, are there any important features to consider regarding bicycle seats?",
          "user_rubrik": "Considering my history of back pain, are there any important features to consider regarding bicycle seats? ",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "For a bicycle seat to alleviate back pain on forest trails and rough paths, prioritize features like extra thick foam padding, memory foam, or gel for superior comfort. Look for shock-absorbing elements such as dual spring suspension to cushion impacts from uneven terrain. An ergonomic or widened design that distributes pressure and supports the tailbone can significantly reduce strain. Additionally, ensure proper bike fit, as adjusting the saddle's incline and handlebar position can help maintain a comfortable, upright posture to minimize stress on your lower back.",
